{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S01、S04、S13等段落的感受词堆叠较密，部分短时间内需要处理的信息偏多，扫读轻松度不如Y。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X虽然更密，但话语中的加亮重点能让人迅速抓住每段心理变化，话与感受交替也更容易建立对应关系；尤其是到时出现的感受，能把音乐的具体变化和人物当下的心理联系起来。相比之下，Y的叙述更轻松直观，但右侧短词较容易形成彼此松散的意象集合，人物为什么从欢喜走向不安、又如何逐渐改变，缺少X那样清楚的层层推进。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4e811aca-6c81-476e-bde0-a1406a9f677b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T000742958632Z", "elapsed_seconds": 61.375, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T00:08:44.342875+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "374ff94d6efe7bf1e0bc99bbf265b43cdf8eb6d4e0e8dd0b320a36d7ada5467c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000